        "publishDate": "2015-10-01",
        "quote": "2015's best rap album isn't by Drake, Kendrick Lamar or Dr. Dre — it's the cast recording of Hamilton, a vital companion to the most creative, most talked-about musical to hit Broadway this millennium."
      },
      {
        "criticName": "Adam Feldman",
