        "publishDate": "2015-08-06",
        "quote": "There has been nothing on Broadway in the past 20 years to rival the riveting, exhilarating and haunting Hamilton (**** out of four stars), which premiered at the Public Theater last winter to wild acclaim, and opened Thursday at the Theatre, its vitality and ingenuity fully intact."
      },
      {
        "criticName": "Peter Marks",
        "outlet": "The Washington Post",
