        "tier": 1,
        "url": "http://www.washingtonpost.com/entertainment/theater_dance/hamilton-making-ecstatic-history/2015/08/06/6bc85fb4-3b72-11e5-8e98-115a3cf7d7ae_story.html",
        "publishDate": "2015-08-06",
        "quote": "“Hamilton,” which had its official opening Thursday night at Broadway’s Theatre, is a captivating mirror of the man whose life it surveys: blazingly original, restlessly innovative, magnetic from start to finish."
      },
      {
        "criticName": "Doug Marino",
